  "summary": "The Textured Painting Workshop is a creative experience for everyone! Do you love drawing but have never tried three-dimensional art before? This workshop is designed just for you! No prior experience is required, just a passion for creativity and exploring the world of art in an entertaining way. In this workshop, you'll learn the fundamentals of textured painting, choose the right materials to create simple 3D paintings and learn clear steps to transform your ideas into vibrant artworks. Don't miss this opportunity! Join us and enjoy a special experience that will untap your artistic and creative skills.",
